Package: swbrd-common
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Evan Brass <brassevan@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: systemd (>= 253), nftables (>= 1.0.9), init-system-helpers (>= 1.54)
Homepage: https://github.com/evan-brass/swbrd
Description: Shared runtime pieces for the swbrd server daemons
 Creates the swbrd system user and state directory, names the ice-dissolve and
 transparent route tables, installs the lo policy rule that makes IP_TRANSPARENT
 sockets work, and owns the two host-wide nftables tables (santa, transparent)
 that more than one swbrd daemon depends on.
 .
 Built for one private host and not fit for redistribution; see
 /usr/share/doc/swbrd-common/copyright.
